## Sandboxing

The devcontainer only mounts this project's folder and its own Claude Code config
directory — nothing else on the host is reachable from inside it. It runs its own isolated
Docker-in-Docker daemon, so Claude Code can build and run containers without ever touching
the host's Docker installation or filesystem.
